                    "sense_definition": "A sideways walking exercise where the feet are alternately placed in front of and behind each other to stretch the lower body.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "exercise",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The coach told the athletes to perform the <w>karaoke</w> to warm up their hips.",
